{"id": "EUVD-2026-57792", "enisaUuid": "f5f7e1c8-67fb-3d27-a180-412427c2690d", "description": "GitPython before 3.1.54 contains an incomplete denylist in unsafe_git_clone_options that omits --template, allowing attackers to achieve arbitrary command execution during clone operations. Attackers can supply --template pointing to a directory containing malicious post-checkout hooks that execute when git clones the repository.", "datePublished": "2026-08-13T11:28:23", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-08T15:24:44", "baseScore": 7.7, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:H/AT:P/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/gitpython-developers/GitPython/security/advisories/GHSA-6p8h-3wgx-97gf", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/gitpython-before-remote-code-execution-via-template"], "aliases": ["GHSA-2726-phmx-rc26", "CVE-2026-73623", "PYSEC-2026-3952"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.84, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "a143a0da-ea1b-3217-8083-7bfb1c83561f", "product": {"name": "GitPython", "vendor": {"name": "gitpython-developers"}}, "product_version": "0 <3.1.54"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "f895422b-2885-3ef0-8b24-2e7b9a61f647", "vendor": {"name": "gitpython-developers"}}], "isExploited": false}